Update nuc9[1,5,6]0_defconfig-s against kernel v4.9-rc6.

The changes were obtained by doing:

	$ make nuc9[1,5,6]0_defconfig
	$ make savedefconfig
	$ diff -u arch/arm/nuc9[1,5,6]0_defconfig defconfig

Cc: Wan ZongShun <mcuos.com@gmail.com>
